{"zh":"<div class=\"drawer-head\"><b>问 AI <span class=\"note\" id=\"chat-who\" style=\"font-weight:400\"></span></b><span><button class=\"btn small ghost\" id=\"chat-setup\" hidden>接入 AI…</button> <button class=\"btn small ghost\" id=\"chat-close\">关闭</button></span></div><div class=\"drawer-body\"><div id=\"chat-log\" class=\"chat-log\"></div><div id=\"chat-setup-panel\" hidden></div><form id=\"chat-form\" class=\"chat-form\"><textarea id=\"chat-in\" rows=\"2\" placeholder=\"看不懂哪里？直接问。AI 会连同你当前拨的参数和页面上的数一起看。\"></textarea><div class=\"bar\"><button class=\"btn small primary\" type=\"submit\" id=\"chat-send\">发送</button><button class=\"btn small ghost\" type=\"button\" id=\"chat-clear\">清空</button><span class=\"note\" id=\"chat-hint\"></span></div></form></div>","en":"<div class=\"drawer-head\"><b>Ask the AI <span class=\"note\" id=\"chat-who\" style=\"font-weight:400\"></span></b><span><button class=\"btn small ghost\" id=\"chat-setup\" hidden>Connect an AI…</button> <button class=\"btn small ghost\" id=\"chat-close\">Close</button></span></div><div class=\"drawer-body\"><div id=\"chat-log\" class=\"chat-log\"></div><div id=\"chat-setup-panel\" hidden></div><form id=\"chat-form\" class=\"chat-form\"><textarea id=\"chat-in\" rows=\"2\" placeholder=\"Something unclear? Just ask. The AI sees the parameters you have set and the numbers on the page.\"></textarea><div class=\"bar\"><button class=\"btn small primary\" type=\"submit\" id=\"chat-send\">Send</button><button class=\"btn small ghost\" type=\"button\" id=\"chat-clear\">Clear</button><span class=\"note\" id=\"chat-hint\"></span></div></form></div>"},
