{"zh":"<div class=\"card tight\" style=\"margin:8px 0\"><h3 style=\"font-size:14px\">接入 AI <span class=\"note\" style=\"font-weight:400\">密钥只存在你这台浏览器里，请求从浏览器直接发给服务商；本站不经手</span></h3>\n        <div class=\"ctl\"><label><span>服务商</span></label><select id=\"ai-p\" class=\"num\" style=\"width:100%\">§0§</select></div>\n        <div class=\"ctl\"><label><span>密钥</span></label><input id=\"ai-key\" class=\"num\" style=\"width:100%\" type=\"password\" value=\"§1§\" placeholder=\"sk-…\"><div class=\"sub\" id=\"ai-hint\"></div></div>\n        <div class=\"ctl\"><label><span>模型（可留空用默认）</span></label><input id=\"ai-model\" class=\"num\" style=\"width:100%\" value=\"§2§\" placeholder=\"默认\"></div>\n        <div class=\"ctl\" id=\"ai-base-row\" hidden><label><span>接口地址</span></label><input id=\"ai-base\" class=\"num\" style=\"width:100%\" value=\"§3§\" placeholder=\"https://…/v1\"></div>\n        <div class=\"bar\"><button class=\"btn small primary\" type=\"button\" id=\"ai-save\">保存并测试</button><button class=\"btn small ghost\" type=\"button\" id=\"ai-cancel\">取消</button><span class=\"note\" id=\"ai-status\"></span></div></div>","en":"<div class=\"card tight\" style=\"margin:8px 0\"><h3 style=\"font-size:14px\">Connect an AI <span class=\"note\" style=\"font-weight:400\">the key is stored only in this browser, and requests go straight from the browser to the provider; this site never handles it</span></h3>\n        <div class=\"ctl\"><label><span>Provider</span></label><select id=\"ai-p\" class=\"num\" style=\"width:100%\">§0§</select></div>\n        <div class=\"ctl\"><label><span>API key</span></label><input id=\"ai-key\" class=\"num\" style=\"width:100%\" type=\"password\" value=\"§1§\" placeholder=\"sk-…\"><div class=\"sub\" id=\"ai-hint\"></div></div>\n        <div class=\"ctl\"><label><span>Model (leave empty for the default)</span></label><input id=\"ai-model\" class=\"num\" style=\"width:100%\" value=\"§2§\" placeholder=\"default\"></div>\n        <div class=\"ctl\" id=\"ai-base-row\" hidden><label><span>Endpoint</span></label><input id=\"ai-base\" class=\"num\" style=\"width:100%\" value=\"§3§\" placeholder=\"https://…/v1\"></div>\n        <div class=\"bar\"><button class=\"btn small primary\" type=\"button\" id=\"ai-save\">Save and test</button><button class=\"btn small ghost\" type=\"button\" id=\"ai-cancel\">Cancel</button><span class=\"note\" id=\"ai-status\"></span></div></div>"},
